# Required for the product path (`kivi run`, `kivi eval`, default --decide llm).
# The model is the last vote for APPLY vs ABSTAIN on a surviving candidate
# (decide/llm_helper.py) — it never finds names and never writes SQLite.
# Copy this file to .env and fill KEY + MODEL. Empty values are unset.
#
# Do not use a thinking / reasoning-only model (GLM-5.3-flash, glm-5p3,
# "thinking" slugs). Those spend seconds on a hidden chain, often return
# empty content, and Kivi then ABSTAINs llm_unavailable. Use a normal
# instruct / Fast path, e.g. Fireworks glm-5p2-fast or Anthropic Haiku.
#
# Latency / ablation (no HTTP): `kivi --decide ungated run ...`
# Cheap doors still apply (no_memory, conflicting_canonicals, low_confidence,
# already_canonical). A surviving candidate APPLYs with no sense check, so a
# homograph like Groww/grow or kiwi/Kivi WILL rewrite in every sentence.
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible chat completions host works. Default provider in
# docs is Anthropic Claude Haiku. Fireworks example:
#   KIVI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.fireworks.ai/inference/v1
#   KIVI_LLM_MODEL=accounts/fireworks/routers/glm-5p2-fast
# Groq (free, less accurate on sense):
#   KIVI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   KIVI_LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b

KIVI_LLM_API_KEY=
KIVI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com/v1
KIVI_LLM_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
